{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07282","headline":"别李氏女子 · 刘长卿","name":"别李氏女子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"念尔嫁犹近，稚年那别亲。\n临歧方教诲，所贵和六姻。\n俛首戴荆钗，欲拜凄且嚬。\n本来儒家子，莫耻梁鸿贫。\n汉川若可涉，水清石磷磷。\n天涯远乡妇，月下孤舟人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}